# Valgrind suppressions for valgrind.yaml (native-checks.yaml). Each one is
# not zumir's, says whose it is, and is as narrow as the stack allows.

# testthat's progress reporting starts a thread in cli; its thread-local
# storage is still allocated when R exits, which memcheck counts as
# "possibly lost" (seen in Stage 5's full run, PR #34). The stack runs
# through cli.so, not zumir.so.
{
   cli-ticker-thread-tls
   Memcheck:Leak
   match-leak-kinds: possible
   fun:calloc
   ...
   fun:_dl_allocate_tls
   ...
   fun:pthread_create*
   obj:*/cli/libs/cli.so
}
